 browser campaign.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/clowder-and-crest-agents.webp","alt","The cat guild’s explorable town and management interface.","https://clowderandcrest.com/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)","items",[81,82,83],"Claude Code","Codex","Gemini CLI","links","Related resources",[89,90,91],"resourceIds","section",{"_58":95,"_25":96},{"_58":93,"_25":94},{"_58":83,"_25":92},"/resources/gemini-cli/","OpenAI Codex","/resources/codex/","Phaser · First Game Guide","/resources/phaser/","Creator evidence",[100],"evidence",{"_58":101,"_25":102,"_103":104},"Read the creator’s multi-tool attribution","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest#built-with","note","README names model/tool roles; todo/codex-todo.md and todo/gemini-todo.md are separate development lanes. These are project records rather than a complete prompt transcript.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[109],{"_58":110,"_25":111,"_103":112},"Open the complete guild-game project","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest","Full Phaser campaign, fifteen minigame types, assets, native shells and tests. Install package dependencies, then npm run dev; the documented dev port is 3200. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.","More ways to play",[116,117],"distribution",{"_58":121,"_25":122,"_103":123},{"_58":118,"_25":119,"_103":120},"GitHub Releases · iOS","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest/releases/tag/v2.7.3","Download — Older v2.7.3 IPA; iOS is not included in v2.8.0. Requires suitable signing and sideloading as described by the author, not direct App Store installation. Not installed in this review.","GitHub Releases · Android","https://github.com/JacobStephens2/clowder-and-crest/releases/tag/v2.8.0","Download — Signed v2.8.0 Android APK for sideloading. This is not a Google Play listing. Installer assets were verified; installation was not tested.","Access type","playable","demo","Play or run",[129],{"_58":130,"_25":69,"_103":131},"Play Clowder & Crest","Browser campaign with mouse/touch minigames. The title screen also offers a spoiler-marked unlocked minigame archive. Android/iOS packaging is included, but native installation has separate platform requirements. Initial asset loading can be slow.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","disclosure","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[139],{"_58":140,"_25":102,"_103":-7},"Read the creator’s tool and code credits","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[145,146,147,148],"Start a guild and complete an opening job.","Read the tool credits and separate coding lanes.","Inspect one minigame and its dedicated playtest.","Change one job mechanic and check campaign progression and saves.","AI workflow / foundation context","JacobStephens2 identifies Claude Code as the primary coding and design partner, Codex CLI as a second coding lane, and Gemini CLI as a third. PixelLab, Midjourney, ElevenLabs and Suno supplied different asset types; the repository contains per-agent task files.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","provenance","Track","2D","track","metadata","Engine","Phaser 3 · TypeScript","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[145,146,147,148],{"_58":140,"_25":102,"_17":135},{"_58":130,"_25":69,"_17":125,"_103":131},{"_58":110,"_25":111,"_183":184,"_103":112},{"_58":101,"_25":102,"_103":104},[180,181,182],[174,175],{"_176":121,"_25":122,"_17":177,"_103":179},{"_176":118,"_25":119,"_17":177,"_103":178},"platform","download","Older v2.7.3 IPA; iOS is not included in v2.8.0. Requires suitable signing and sideloading as described by the author, not direct App Store installation. Not installed in this review.","Signed v2.8.0 Android APK for sideloading. This is not a Google Play listing. Installer assets were verified; installation was not tested.","phaser","codex","gemini-cli","scope","complete-project",{"_186":187}